### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-locations.ftl.

## Smart folder editor
tui-locations-smart-examples = Query examples:
tui-locations-smart-hints = Enter save · Tab next · Space tick · Esc cancel

