tui-locations-hostkey-hints = Tab next · Enter press the focused button · Esc don't trust

## Archives
tui-locations-password-hints = Enter unlock · Tab next · Esc cancel
tui-locations-extract-hints = Enter extract · Tab next · Space tick · Esc cancel
tui-locations-compress-hints = Tab next · Left/Right choose · Enter compress · Esc cancel
tui-locations-extract-no-dest = Type the folder to extract to.
tui-locations-archive-name-empty = Type a name for the archive.
